"    :alt: Translate me on Weblate\n"
".. |badge5| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/runboat-Try%20me-875A7B.png\n"
"    :target: https://runboat.odoo-community.org/builds?repo=OCA/l10n-mexico&target_branch=20.0\n"
"    :alt: Try me on Runboat\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3| |badge4| |badge5|\n"
"\n"
"Download the public SAT list of taxpayers under article 69-B of the CFF\n"
"and look up an RFC.\n"
"\n"
"The result includes the taxpayer name, the SAT status (Presunto,\n"
"Definitivo, Desvirtuado or Sentencia Favorable) and the official\n"
"reference (número y fecha de oficio). The list is kept in memory for 15\n"
"days.\n"
"\n"
"This module does not block invoices. Other modules use it to check\n"
"customers or vendors.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"No configuration is required.\n"
"\n"
"The Odoo server must be able to reach:\n"
"\n"
"``http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/cifras_sat/Documents/Listado_Completo_69-B.csv``\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"Other modules call ``lookup_taxpayer`` with an RFC.\n"
"\n"
"The call returns the name, SAT status and official reference when the\n"
"RFC is on the list. It returns an empty result when the RFC is not\n"
"listed or when it is a generic invoice RFC (``XAXX010101000``,\n"
"``XEXX010101000``).\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/l10n-mexico/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/l10n-mexico/issues/new?body=module:%20l10n_mx_sat_69b%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
